-- test: in edition 0.5, a package function `update` whose first parameter is a `Map` or a type parameter is U1002 at its name, since `m.update(...)` is the map's built-in method, and so is an import of one; an `update` on another type is accepted (ADR 0119 rule 18, moved to edition 0.5 by ADR 0139 rule 6)
-- spec: spec/21 §2
-- expect: error U1002 at src/a.una:8:5
-- expect: error U1002 at src/b.una:3:11
-- expect: error U1002 at src/c.una:3:5
module a

pub update(m: Map[Text, Int], key: Text) -> Map[Text, Int] = m

pub kind Counter
  count: Int
